@format 1
@id split.section-sort
@title Sort sections
@area Split
@entry input
@summary Sort sections by name while keeping the selected section active.
@flow TB
@related shared.synchronize-sections
@tag section
@tag section-sort

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Sort sections request <input>
- Receive the requested section change @ flow.PFlowSectionSort(...)
> guard

[guard] Check effective change <decision>
- Confirm the section exists and the requested state differs where applicable @ flow.PFlowSectionSort(...)
? "The request changes section state" > mutate
? "The request is invalid or already satisfied" > unchanged

[mutate] Change section state <process>
- Sort sections by name and relocate the active selection @ flow.PFlowSectionSort(...)
- Record the section change @ flow.PFlowSectionRecord(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Section state is unchanged.
